WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.380
You need two clear zip bags, two paper towels, tape, a marker, and 12 to 20 large

2
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.780
dry beans from the grocery store, such as lima or pinto.

3
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.650
Fold a paper towel into each bag.

4
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.970
Wet one until damp but not dripping.

5
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.470
Set four to six beans on each towel.

6
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:23.070
Close the bags almost all the way, and tape them to a bright window, away from hot

7
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.070
sun.

8
00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:28.693
Check each day. In a warm room, a white root usually shows in three to seven days.

9
00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:30.613
Expect nothing in the dry bag.

10
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:32.367
Stay with your child.

11
00:00:32.747 --> 00:00:36.647
Keep beans away from children under 4, Never taste a bean or sprout.
